  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "くぅ～！　やっぱこの服、どれもマジでいいっす！\n大人の男の大人なセンス、バクハツしてるっす！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "伊瀬谷 四季"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_b:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "オシャレでカッコイイよな！　\nでも、高そうなお店だったし、入る時は緊張した～。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "秋山 隼人"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_b:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "オレもオレも！　けど、店員さん優しかったよな。\nあれが、ラグジュアリーな雰囲気ってやつ？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "若里 春名"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_b:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あと、洋服の店なのに、スッゲーいい匂いしたし！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "若里 春名"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_b:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 10
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "お店の中で、そんなこと気にしてたんですか……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "冬美 旬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_b:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 13
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ふふ。朝からたくさん歩いたのに……。\nみんな元気、だね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "榊 夏来"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_b:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 14
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "みんな、今日はオレたちの買い物に\n付き合ってくれてありがとう。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "柏木 翼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_b:step-18:text",
        "step_id": 18,
        "step_index": 17,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 17
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "5人が一緒に来てくれて助かったぜ。\nおかげで、特番用のいい衣装が手に入ったな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天道 輝"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_b:step-19:text",
        "step_id": 19,
        "step_index": 18,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 18
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "これなら最近の若い子たちに受けて、\nプロデュース部門でも高評価をもらえそうですね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "柏木 翼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_b:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あとはじいさんが、この衣装を見て、\nやる気になってくれるといいんだが……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天道 輝"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
